//
// Structure has two options:
//   1. Propagate freely: move through the lattice at c
//   2. Bind: cycle through internal gauge structure
// Both persist. Two geometries of the same structure.
//
// Law 2 is satisfied throughout: total structure is conserved;
// only geometry changes. Binding doesn't create energy; it changes
// geometry. Unbinding doesn't destroy energy; it changes geometry back.
//
// Derives from: theory.physics.lattice, theory.coherence.law2
